  'Child left in a hot car': ['"There\'s a baby in a car seat. Windows up. It\'s so hot. I don\'t see anybody. Should I break the window? Tell me what to do."', '"She\'s crying, she\'s red, I\'m knocking on the glass. Please hurry. Please."'],
  'Overheated hiker': ['"He just sat down on the trail and now he doesn\'t know what day it is. I gave him my water. Is that okay?"', '"He\'s dizzy and he stopped sweating. My Scout leader said that\'s bad. Is that bad?"'],
  'Downed power line': ['"It\'s sparking in the road and people keep driving around it. A kid on a bike almost went right through."', '"Line\'s down across the street. I can hear it buzzing from my porch. My dog wants to go see. My dog is not allowed to go see."'],
  'Tree on a car': ['"The oak came down on my car. I was in the house, I\'m fine. I just... I had that car since college."', '"Big tree, little car. Nobody hurt. I\'m standing in the rain looking at it. I don\'t know why I called you. I didn\'t know who else to call."'],
  'Flooded underpass': ['"There\'s a car stuck in the water under the bridge and the guy\'s still inside. Water\'s at the door. He\'s waving."', '"He drove right in. Said it didn\'t look deep. It\'s deep."'],
  'Minor crash in fog': ['"We bumped. Like, a bump. We\'re both fine. We\'re both very sorry. We just don\'t know what to do next."', '"Can\'t see ten feet. We\'re pulled over with our flashers on. Please come before someone hits us."'],
  'Disabled vehicle': ['"There\'s a car just stopped in the lane, no lights. I almost hit it. In this fog somebody will."', '"Lady\'s sitting in it with her hands on the wheel. Not moving. I don\'t know if she\'s okay."'],
  'Stalled car in the rain': ['"Car won\'t start, I\'m in the middle of the intersection, it\'s pouring. People are being really rude about it."', '"I need somebody to help push. I asked three people. One of them said good luck."'],
  'Slip and fall': ['Store clerk: "Customer slipped by the door. She says she\'s fine and she wants to report it. Both."', '"I\'m okay, I\'m okay, my pride\'s broken. I just want it written down so it doesn\'t happen to somebody\'s grandma."'],
  'Cold-night welfare check': ['"There\'s a man sleeping on the bench by the fountain. It\'s getting real cold. I gave him my scarf. He needs more than a scarf."', 'Shelter staff: "We have beds tonight. He doesn\'t like the shelter. Maybe he\'ll listen to an officer."'],
  'Space heater smoke': ['"I smell smoke from 4C. Mrs. Lin uses a space heater with an extension cord. I knocked. No answer. She doesn\'t hear well."', '"Smells like burning plastic in the hall. Everybody\'s just standing around smelling it."']
